---
layout: base.njk
title: Page Not Found
permalink: /404.html
robots: noindex
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<div class="static-page" style="text-align: center;">
  <h1>404 — This Page Doesn't Exist</h1>
  <p>The page you're looking for has moved or never existed. The site was reorganized, so old links may be out of date.</p>
  <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <a href="/articles/" class="btn btn-primary">Browse All Articles</a>
  </p>
  <h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Popular sections</h2>
  <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
    {% for cat in categories %}
    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><a href="/{{ cat.slug }}/">{{ cat.icon }} {{ cat.name }}</a></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
